    "title": "Coverage report is missing some files",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros-controls/ros2_control/issues/2496",
    "body": "For example the range_sensor.hpp is missing (and there is no test for it!)\n\nhttps://app.codecov.io/gh/ros-controls/ros2_control/tree/master/controller_interface%2Finclude%2Fsemantic_components\n\n<img width=\"885\" height=\"563\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f80616a1-211d-480c-b550-d5ee73f4c10a\" />\n\n<img width=\"720\" height=\"541\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3165a51b-cc25-4b8e-b1d8-7ef1fc7ca79c\" />",
